==Battleground==
*2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Mega Baa Baa]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*3 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Makoto Shishio (Enemy)|Makoto Shishio]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**10 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**1 [[Mr. Mer]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
**3 [[Mega Baa Baa]]s spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 60~66.67 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,000f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
**1 [[Othom]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.

